@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8790
@actorId = USER-INTEGRATION-001
@tenantId = TENANT-INTEGRATION
@candidateId = replace-after-create

### 健康检查
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 1. 创建候选版本
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/l1/evolution/candidates
Content-Type: application/json
x-request-id: REQ-HTTP-001
x-actor-id: {{actorId}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenantId}}
idempotency-key: IDEMP-HTTP-001

{
  "context": {
    "actorId": "{{actorId}}",
    "actorType": "human",
    "tenantId": "{{tenantId}}",
    "subjectUserId": "{{actorId}}",
    "roles": [],
    "idempotencyKey": "IDEMP-HTTP-001"
  },
  "candidate": {
    "evolutionPath": "PROMPT_EVOLUTION",
    "scenarioId": "SCN-05",
    "subjectUserId": "{{actorId}}",
    "scope": "PERSONAL",
    "sourceRefs": ["MSG-HTTP-001"],
    "evidence": [{"type": "human_feedback", "ref": "MSG-HTTP-001"}],
    "candidateVersion": {
      "versionId": "VER-HTTP-001",
      "scenarioId": "SCN-05",
      "skill": "企业文化活动智能策划",
      "risk": "LOW",
      "evidenceReady": true
    }
  }
}

### 2. 风险判断
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/l1/evolution/candidates/{{candidateId}}/risk-check
Content-Type: application/json

{"context":{"actorId":"{{actorId}}","actorType":"human","tenantId":"{{tenantId}}","subjectUserId":"{{actorId}}"}}

### 3. 本人确认
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/l1/evolution/candidates/{{candidateId}}/confirmations
Content-Type: application/json

{"context":{"actorId":"{{actorId}}","actorType":"human","tenantId":"{{tenantId}}","subjectUserId":"{{actorId}}"},"action":"KEEP","riskNoticeShown":true}

### 4. 发布并写入1.7
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/l1/evolution/candidates/{{candidateId}}/publish
Content-Type: application/json

{"context":{"actorId":"{{actorId}}","actorType":"human","tenantId":"{{tenantId}}","subjectUserId":"{{actorId}}"}}

### 5. 查询审计
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/l1/evolution/audit
